# Data Flow Diagrams (DFD)

## Level 0 Context Diagram (System Level)

```mermaid
graph TD
    User1[Donor Persona] -->|Register / Toggle Availability / Volunteer| System((Blood Donation Management System))
    User2[Patient Persona] -->|Submit Request / Search Donors| System
    User3[Admin Persona] -->|Manage Users / Assign Donors / Audit Logs| System
    System -->|Matching Requests / Notifications| User1
    System -->|Request Fulfillment Status| User2
    System -->|System Metrics & Audit Data| User3
```

---

## Level 1 Process Diagram (Component Level)

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Frontend Client
        ReactApp[React SPA Router]
    end

    subgraph FastAPI REST Backend
        AuthService[Auth Router /auth]
        AdminService[Admin Router /admin]
        DonorService[Donor Router /donor]
        PatientService[Patient Router /patient]
    end

    subgraph Data Layer
        SQLiteDB[(SQLite Database - blood_donation.db)]
    end

    ReactApp -->|POST /auth/login| AuthService
    ReactApp -->|GET/PUT /donor/dashboard| DonorService
    ReactApp -->|GET/POST /patient/requests| PatientService
    ReactApp -->|GET/PUT/DELETE /admin/*| AdminService

    AuthService -->|Read/Write Users| SQLiteDB
    DonorService -->|Read/Write Donations & Status| SQLiteDB
    PatientService -->|Create Blood Requests| SQLiteDB
    AdminService -->|Aggregate Metrics & Full CRUD| SQLiteDB
```
